# Product Category page (locked spec)

Products third tab: Mattex Products | **Product Category** | Mattex Chain Products.

Add / rename / delete. Delete blocked while any product (including Trash) still uses that category, and blocked for the last category. Disabled Delete uses a visible hover tooltip that opens above the button (fixed position, rendered on `document.body` so no table clips it). Edit and Delete labels never wrap onto two lines. Counts include Trash. Row open icon jumps to Mattex Products Edit. Select products to move; Add products assigns from the rest of the catalog. One product, one category. Never unassign to empty. Trash rows are read-only. Product form still has Add category.

```jsx
// ❌ BAD
deleteAdminCategory(id); // while products remain
assignAdminProductsCategory(ids, "");

// ✅ GOOD
<button disabled={category.count > 0 || categories.length <= 1}>Delete</button>
assignAdminProductsCategory(ids, otherCategoryName);
```
